  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0000" ref="k9q_h4e_j2q">會稽思世子道生</persName>，字延長。帝為會稽王，立道生為世子，拜散騎侍郎、給事中。性疏躁，不修行業，多失禮度，竟以幽廢而卒，時年二十四，無後。及<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0066" ref="uke_dff_yrf">孝武帝</persName>即位，嘗晝日見道生及<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0079" ref="70z_zog_t15">臨川獻王郁</persName>，鬱曰：「大郎饑乏辛苦。」言竟不見。帝傷感，因以西陽王<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0111" ref="tph_dpd_6m5">錄</persName>玄孫<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0114" ref="1gr_agz_a4h">珣之</persName>為後。珣之曆吳興太守。<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0127" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA">劉裕</persName>之伐關中，以為諮議參軍。時帝道方謝，珣之為宗室之美，與<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0156" ref="hxp_cd6_qcl">梁王珍之</persName>俱被害。</p>
</text>
